# --- Editors / IDE ---
# `**/.vscode/*` (not `.vscode/`): the `/*` keeps the dir itself un-excluded so
# the negations below still work, and `**/` makes it apply at every depth
# (a pattern with an internal slash is otherwise anchored to this file's dir).
**/.vscode/*
!**/.vscode/launch.json
!**/.vscode/tasks.json
!**/.vscode/extensions.json
!**/.vscode/modular-clipboard.json
.vscode-test/
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo
*~
.hidden-items.json
.pseudo-folders.json

# --- AI assistants ---
.claude/
.cursor/
CLAUDE.local.md

# --- Environment / secrets ---
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.p8
*.key
*.keystore

